        "`protocol_config.refund_timeout_slots` of creation. Works for both",
        "abandoned (Created) and funded-but-unsettled (Funded) escrows. Refunds",
        "the escrowed amount to the consumer and closes the escrow (rent back to",
        "the consumer). This is the consumer safety valve against an unavailable",
        "gateway — it does not require the admin."
